Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:33.85,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,嘘つき上手に　なれやしない私の
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:40.69,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,痩せた記憶　塗り替えたいの
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:47.61,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,言い訳もせずにただ頷く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:51.65,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,下手な嘘も　見抜けなくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:58.20,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,それのどこが正義だと言うのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:05.34,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,ごめん　その一言で許されるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:12.05,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,見つけられて見つめられて満たされていく
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:19.22,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,騙して、騙されても憎めない人よ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:26.14,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,今夜こそは捕まえて
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:30.41,OP-TOP,OP,0,0,0,,Hold me tight tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.94,0:00:06.56,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,Hold me, Hold me, 抓住我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:19.79,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,眼神孤寂的人
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.79,0:00:26.25,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,心中永存温柔与美丽
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.69,0:00:33.85,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,学不会撒谎的我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:40.69,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,只想将那消瘦的记忆 一笔笔涂改
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.73,0:00:47.61,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,不作辩解 一味点头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.61,0:00:51.65,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,连显而易见的谎言都无法看穿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.65,0:00:58.20,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,如此这般 谈何正义
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.20,0:01:05.34,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,对不起 如果道歉就能被原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.34,0:01:12.05,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,那就被找到 被注视 然后被满足
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.05,0:01:19.22,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,即便欺骗 即便被骗 也无怨无恨的人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.52,0:01:26.14,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,今夜请一定把我抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.44,0:01:30.41,OP-BOTTOM-S,OP,0,0,0,,Hold me tight tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:39.17,ED-J,,0,0,0,,呼吸数　心拍数も
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:47.72,ED-J,,0,0,0,,赤く染めた空に想定外に上ってゆく
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:55.26,ED-J,,0,0,0,,君の前..こんなにも知らぬ顔で
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:59.52,ED-J,,0,0,0,,吹き抜ける秋風
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:08.53,ED-J,,0,0,0,,行かないで..　行かないで..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:17.04,ED-J,,0,0,0,,ねぇ　時が戻りあの頃の二人に戻れたら
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:21.54,ED-J,,0,0,0,,そう　輝く夢を追いかけて
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:27.38,ED-J,,0,0,0,,まだ　そこに私はいますか？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:31.68,ED-J,,0,0,0,,忘れてよ　忘れてよ..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:35.97,ED-J,,0,0,0,,戻れない　もう戻れない..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:44.48,ED-J,,0,0,0,,空回り　心の声　舞い散っている
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:48.82,ED-J,,0,0,0,,いつまでも　いつまでも..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:53.28,ED-J,,0,0,0,,忘れない　忘れないで..
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:08:03.25,ED-J,,0,0,0,,夢じゃなくて　温かい手握っていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:39.17,ED-S,,0,0,0,,在那绯红的天空下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.17,0:06:47.72,ED-S,,0,0,0,,呼吸和心跳都意外加快
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:55.26,ED-S,,0,0,0,,面前的你…却是一副陌生表情
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.26,0:06:59.52,ED-S,,0,0,0,,秋风扫过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.52,0:07:08.53,ED-S,,0,0,0,,不要走… 不要走…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.53,0:07:17.04,ED-S,,0,0,0,,如果时间倒流 你我回到那时
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.04,0:07:21.54,ED-S,,0,0,0,,我们追逐着灿烂的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.54,0:07:27.38,ED-S,,0,0,0,,我是否仍在你身边？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:31.68,ED-S,,0,0,0,,忘记吧 忘记吧…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.68,0:07:35.97,ED-S,,0,0,0,,回不去 已回不去…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.97,0:07:44.48,ED-S,,0,0,0,,心中声音无人倾听 只得随风消散
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:48.82,ED-S,,0,0,0,,不论何时 不论何时…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:53.28,ED-S,,0,0,0,,都不要忘记 不要忘记…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.28,0:08:03.25,ED-S,,0,0,0,,希望这不是梦 让我紧握那温暖的手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:54.01,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)\fn方正大标宋_GBK\b1}犯人到来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.55,0:03:11.96,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,{\fn方正行楷_GBK\b1}B{\fs45}部分继续
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.07,0:02:57.70,Graphics,,0,0,0,,{\c&H473F67&\bord1\3c&HFFFFFF&\fn@银色子弹思源体简\fs36\pos(244,340)\frz-90\fry6}不可以轻易{\c&H797AF4&}杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:03:03.71,Graphics,,0,0,0,,{\c&H6856F4&\bord1\3c&HFFFFFF&\fn银色子弹思源体简\fs36\pos(236,40)}不要杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.01,0:04:05.98,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(301,1)}初期费用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.26,0:04:05.98,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(113,208)}房租
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.64,0:04:05.98,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(122,333)}押金
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.02,0:04:05.98,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(120,461)}礼金
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.39,0:04:05.98,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(190,581)}中介费
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:05.98,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H000000&\bord0\shad0\pos(154,710)}火灾保险费
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:05.98,Note,,0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H000000&\bord1\shad0\pos(82,870)\3c&HD9F4C5&\4c&HD9F4C5&}合计
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.65,0:01:33.78,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	米花町  米花町
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.99,0:01:35.49,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	下车的乘客请…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.82,0:01:36.40,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:37.53,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这里可是米花町
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.53,0:01:38.16,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	你想死吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.16,0:01:38.91,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	快回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:41.12,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	正经人可不会靠近这个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.91,0:01:43.02,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不必担心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:46.33,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	因为我是杀人的那一方
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.18,0:01:59.80,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	那家伙就在这个城市的某个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.09,0:02:03.39,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	我来到这里的唯一目的  就是杀死他
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.81,0:02:05.27,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	来米花町的这张车票
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.64,0:02:07.89,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	就是通往惨剧的单程票
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.52,0:02:10.90,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	小兰  快一点啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.90,0:02:12.23,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	等等我  园子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.65,0:02:15.19,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	你弄掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.32,0:02:16.03,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.24,0:02:17.15,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	那人好可疑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.15,0:02:19.49,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	在这个地方很常见的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.28,0:02:21.37,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.37,0:02:23.12,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	通往惨剧的单程…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.20,0:02:26.72,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	没有插车票的口
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.83,0:02:29.58,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	先生  持车票的请走这个闸机
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.25,0:02:31.04,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	原来有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.83,0:02:33.59,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	他搞什么啊  好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.84,0:02:36.21,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	园子  别笑别人啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.21,0:02:37.42,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:39.30,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	搞不好会被杀掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.69,0:02:50.19,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.48,0:02:53.61,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	我还没闲到会因为这么点小事就杀人
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.82,0:02:55.07,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	你捡了条小命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:01.36,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这里就是米花町  我憧憬已久的犯罪都市
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:03.70,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	我今后要居住的城市
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.20,0:03:06.04,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	他的名字叫犯泽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.37,0:03:09.16,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	尚未发生的案件的…犯人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.63,0:03:14.88,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	首先  最重要的是找房子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.17,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	房租不要高于5万日元…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.30,0:03:19.63,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	只要3万2？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.97,0:03:22.05,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	采光充足  位于朝南的角落
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.05,0:03:23.89,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	房龄5年  浴室厕所分开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.89,0:03:24.76,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这只要3万2？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.97,0:03:26.76,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不  这一定是钓鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:28.89,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	明明没有这么好的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.89,0:03:31.10,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	却故意放出来当圈套  吸引顾客进店
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.73,0:03:34.86,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	要是不小心说出「我想去看看这套房子」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:39.74,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这套刚刚被人签掉了  我忘记撤下来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.74,0:03:42.57,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	店员肯定会这么说  然后给我推荐贵的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:44.20,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	要是当真如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.12,0:03:46.74,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.03,0:03:51.04,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	贴在外面的那套3万2的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.50,0:03:54.63,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	一定还有吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.71,0:03:55.42,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	有的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.42,0:03:55.84,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	有吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:57.34,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	那是当然
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:04:00.30,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这个房东人也很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.30,0:04:02.93,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不收押金和礼金
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:05.97,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	初期费用居然能这么便宜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.47,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	话不多说直接看房
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.76,0:04:11.06,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	有点奇怪啊  再怎么说也太便宜了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.06,0:04:13.85,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	会不会房间非常脏  或者出门就是坟场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:15.05,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.05,0:04:15.90,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	高级公寓
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:16.94,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这间房
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:18.15,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	好棒的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:20.15,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	风景也超棒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.31,0:04:21.19,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.19,0:04:23.86,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	离便利店也很近  到车站只要步行3分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.86,0:04:24.99,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	简直完美
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.16,0:04:25.87,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.83,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这间屋子里是不是有东西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.20,0:04:30.79,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	也太便宜了点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.37,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不不不  很普通的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.75,0:04:34.54,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	就是很普通的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:36.33,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:38.21,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:39.55,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	就在这个位置
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.55,0:04:43.42,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	一个人渣高尔夫球手用高尔夫球杆打死了模特女友
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.42,0:04:44.01,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	别说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:46.68,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这里之前可是沾满了血
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.68,0:04:47.72,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	别指啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.35,0:04:53.60,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	在发生过凶杀案的房子里制定杀死那个人的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:04:56.85,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	好可怕啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.36,0:04:59.90,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	我  我还想看看别的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:00.52,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.86,0:05:02.03,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这间房子是
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.03,0:05:05.95,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	床底下的行李箱里发现了被塞在里面的遗体
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.95,0:05:06.41,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	别说啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:09.62,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这里是姐姐在浴室杀害了妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:11.54,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	都不敢挤洗发水了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.83,0:05:13.75,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这里就…如你所见
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.08,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	请问…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.29,0:05:18.50,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	有没有不是凶宅的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.88,0:05:20.34,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	有倒是有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.42,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	七八平米小单间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.42,0:05:24.59,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	房龄20年  木造  没浴室
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:25.59,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	房租15万
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:28.09,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	外加  三个月押金  三个月礼金
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.09,0:05:29.39,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这不对劲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.39,0:05:31.60,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	你可别小瞧了这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.60,0:05:33.89,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	你以为这里是哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.10,0:05:35.73,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这可是米花町
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.94,0:05:37.90,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	米花町
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.19,0:05:40.65,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	非凶宅可是很稀有的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.82,0:05:45.11,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这二十年来  凶宅数量爆炸式增长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:49.53,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不知是谁的阴谋  还是死神在作祟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.91,0:05:53.41,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	没钱的人就只能住凶宅
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.41,0:05:55.41,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这就是这里的现实
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.71,0:05:56.71,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	懂了没
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.71,0:06:00.18,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	我劝你还是回乡下去吧  黄毛小子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.67,0:06:05.26,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	我想再看看最开始那套房子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.63,0:06:07.63,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这房子是真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.63,0:06:08.63,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.01,0:06:10.22,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	可是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.43,0:06:13.10,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	凶宅还要3万2  是不是有点贵啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.22,0:06:16.35,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不不不  不能再便宜了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.35,0:06:20.35,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	那这样呢  能给我降价吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.57,0:06:24.32,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	降价了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:27.40,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	你要不要
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.36,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	让我考虑一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.49,0:06:32.62,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	新生活还很遥远
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.29,0:08:05.58,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	小剧场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.79,0:08:06.59,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	在哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.17,0:08:10.30,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	米花町好多人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.55,0:08:14.18,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	但是  那个人就在这里的某个地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:17.76,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不论他躲在哪里  我都一定会把他找到
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.89,0:08:18.81,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	然后杀掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.02,0:08:21.31,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	我之前在这里看到洋子了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.31,0:08:23.19,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	那个偶像冲野洋子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.19,0:08:24.81,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	嗯  她普通地在购物
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.81,0:08:25.90,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	真的假的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.28,0:08:30.94,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	再见啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.90,0:08:34.16,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	我这个身心一片漆黑的犯泽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.16,0:08:35.03,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	为了杀死他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:36.20,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	从岛根县出云市
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:39.45,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	不远万里来到米花町这个世界首屈一指的犯罪都市
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.45,0:08:41.00,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	可一抵达就遭遇重大危机
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.46,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	找不到心仪的房子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.46,0:08:45.04,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	到处都是凶宅  这里到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.04,0:08:45.96,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	但是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.34,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	碰巧路过的饭团小鬼给了我灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.34,0:08:50.38,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	让我想到了一个完美的好主意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.38,0:08:53.01,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	这下就能无忧无虑地过犯人生活了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.01,0:08:55.30,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	下集  奇迹般的邂逅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.38,0:08:58.55,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	话说回来  疯狂恶搞人家的作品还没有被骂  真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.68,0:08:59.81,DefaultSingle-S,,0,0,0,,	敬请期待
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.13,0:04:37.59,Note,,0,0,0,,	{\fad(224,0)}注：正片第3集（拆分版3）偶像密室杀人事件
